        <div class="card-body">
            <ol class="mb-0">
                <li>Fee is subsidized for all categories except <strong>S</strong> and <strong>X</strong>. No fee relaxation is available for S and X categories.</li>
                <li>The number of seats may be revised/modified without prior notice.</li>
                <li>In <strong>Computer Science</strong>, one third of seats in every category are reserved for Pre-Medical candidates. Remaining seats are for other combinations. Unfilled seats will be transferred to the other group.</li>
                <li><strong>L</strong> (Backward Districts of Punjab): Attock, Bahawalnagar, Bahawalpur, Bhakkar, Chakwal, D.G. Khan, Jhang, Jhelum, Layyah, Muzaffargarh, Mianwali, Rahim Yar Khan, Rajanpur.</li>
                <li>Details of eligibility and documents required are given in the official Prospectus.</li>
